  "description": "Bewhiskered (BWS) is an annual furry convention held in Durham, in North Carolina's Research Triangle region, organized by the NC Anthro Society. The inaugural event was scheduled for October 2020 but was postponed, and the first Bewhiskered took place November 12 to 14, 2021. Its themes have ranged from space exploration to murder mysteries and arcades, and attendance has grown from 481 in 2022 to over 2,100 in 2026. The convention's charity is SAFE Haven for Cats.",
